  "details": "Description\n\nWhen using Steam Frame to play VRChat, I get severe stuttering during loading (world transitions, avatar loading). The stuttering disappears ONLY while the SteamVR dashboard is open, then returns immediately when closed. My output log shows repeated [TextureManagement] Over cache size but failed to find any textures to remove errors, multiple AssetBundleSizeTooLarge avatar download failures, frequent NullReferenceException UI errors, and UdonBehaviour execution halts. Network is stable (packet loss <1%, ping <10ms). Already tested all SteamVR/Steam Frame settings without improvement.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nReproduction Steps:\n\nLaunch VRChat via Steam Frame (SteamVR streaming).\n\nJoin any world with multiple avatars or moderate player count.\n\nStuttering occurs consistently during avatar/world loading.\n\nWorkarounds Attempted:\n\nNone effective. Opening the SteamVR dashboard temporarily reduces stuttering, but it returns immediately upon closing. All SteamVR and Steam Frame settings have been tested without success.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: パフォーマンス\n\n- Frequency: いつも\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.3p2-1921-15c4a824b2-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-10-21_18-09-34.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_7b9928b5-6b33-4926-903f-c1b31857066e/1/file)",
